## Amplify env + IAM scripts (admin repo)

- Merge Bedrock keys **without wiping** other env: `scripts/set-amplify-bedrock-env.ps1`
  - Refuses update if `get-app` JSON is dirty (SSL noise) or existing key count &lt; 10.
- Full restore from dotenv: `scripts/set-amplify-env-vars.ps1` (replaces **all** app env — use carefully).
- IAM inline policy: `scripts/attach-amplify-bedrock-iam.ps1` + `documentation/admin_help_chat/bedrock-invoke-policy.json`
- Policy name: `AdminHelpBedrockInvoke` on Amplify SSR / service role (`bedrock:InvokeModel`).

```powershell
# Merge Bedrock onto prod hub (defaults)
.\scripts\set-amplify-bedrock-env.ps1
# Dev hub
.\scripts\set-amplify-bedrock-env.ps1 -AppId d3qk5eouzr7b80
```

After env or `amplify.yml` changes: RELEASE on `release/v1.0.0`.

## Bolting Admin Help onto another frontend (satellite / clone)

1. Copy `src/lib/adminHelp/`, API route, `AdminHelpChat`, and mount in the admin layout client.
2. Add `@aws-sdk/client-bedrock-runtime`; set the three `BEDROCK_*` env vars.
3. Ensure Clerk-gated admin access before invoke.
4. Extend knowledge pack (`hubGuides`, `howTos`, `operatorGuides`, `routeMap`) for that product’s tiles — do not dump all `documentation/**/*.html` into the prompt.
5. Push Amplify env with merge script (us-east-2 app id); attach Bedrock IAM to that app’s SSR role.
6. Keep retail Ask wired through Spring → engine if the clone has retail; do not merge the two chat APIs.

## Retail Ask (engine) — reminders

- Engine: `gas_station_ai_engine/llm/bedrock.py` — `explain` vs `ask`, account gate `PROJECT_ACCOUNT`.
- Amplify **cannot** reach the internal engine ALB; retail Ask stays Admin → Spring → `RETAIL_ENGINE_BASE_URL`.
- Admin Help must **not** reuse `/api/retail-brief/chat`.

## Anti-patterns

```text
❌ Admin Help → AI engine /v1/chat
❌ Browser → Bedrock with embedded AWS keys
❌ update-app with only BEDROCK_* after a failed get-app JSON parse (wipes env)
❌ Fine-tuning / “embed all admin pages into the model”
❌ Teaching SUPER_ADMIN-only flows to tenant ADMIN
```

```text
✅ Next.js server route + IAM role / default credential chain
✅ Curated knowledge pack + pathname retrieval
✅ Same Claude Sonnet model id, separate system prompt
✅ Amplify list/update in us-east-2; Bedrock invoke in us-east-1
```

